Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=28}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.41,0:02:19.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong\Nwith these things!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They aren't normal!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.42,0:02:24.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.09,0:02:26.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Duuuuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:30.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's his fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.51,0:02:31.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whose?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.51,0:02:32.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The South Bird!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.34,0:02:34.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's him! He's\Ncontrolling the bugs!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.68,0:02:38.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He can control\Nbugs and guide ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.98,0:02:47.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shh! Quiet.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.14,0:02:49.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys hear anything?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.89,0:02:53.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Somethin'.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.96,0:02:56.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it sure doesn't\Nsound like any bird to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.01,0:02:57.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:02:59.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.18,0:03:00.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are they? Boulders?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.80,0:03:02.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks\Nlike an avalanche!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.76,0:03:04.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong! They're bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:06.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ladybugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.22,0:03:08.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:12.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh heh heh! Heh heh heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:13.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.87,0:03:16.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no end to them!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.04,0:03:17.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They just keep popping up!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.98,0:03:19.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid crickets!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.69,0:03:23.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Oh come on! You think\Nyou can beat me? Do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.13,0:03:24.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Duuuuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:25.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wish those birds
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.81,0:03:27.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,were as easy to see\Nas they are to hear.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.11,0:03:29.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A slug that\Nsize needs a lot of salt!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.14,0:03:33.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can you think of\Ncooking at a time like this?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.77,0:03:35.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not,\Nsalt dissolves slugs, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:37.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of all this running!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.90,0:03:39.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's stand and fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.01,0:03:42.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, you bugs, bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.01,0:03:42.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.98,0:03:45.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just one sting\Nand you're history!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.19,0:03:47.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fireflies!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.07,0:03:47.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:49.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eww! Roaches!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.61,0:03:50.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pigs!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.29,0:03:52.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:56.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So whaddaya think about
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.18,0:03:59.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We hit the jackpot!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.39,0:04:03.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! I'll say!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.22,0:04:04.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.18,0:04:05.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a fine piece of gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.63,0:04:09.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? No way.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.68,0:04:12.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You punks have no\Nright to take that gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:14.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.56,0:04:15.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No right?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.81,0:04:18.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll show ya what\Ngives us the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.27,0:04:23.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Big Chop!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.28,0:04:27.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, you damn fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.87,0:04:32.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're way stronger than you\Nand your pals, old man!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.19,0:04:35.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd say that alone gives us\Nthe right to take what we want,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.69,0:04:37.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when we want, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:39.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Come on! Let's dance!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.53,0:04:42.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind,\NI'm cutting in!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.12,0:04:44.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Havoc sonar!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.63,0:04:56.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lousy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:58.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sarquiss, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.84,0:05:00.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to finish him\Noff my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.97,0:05:04.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's him again.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.72,0:05:07.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The one with those\NSpring‐Spring fruit powers.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.05,0:05:09.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shojo, run,\Nget out of there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Spring...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:15.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Sniper!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.89,0:05:20.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Shojo!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.89,0:05:35.02,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Old‐timer! Look what we found!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.06,0:05:37.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Gold! A bell‐shaped ingot!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.99,0:05:51.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Look! It's just like\Nit says here in the logbook!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.62,0:05:52.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Gold bells!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.62,0:05:54.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The story's true!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.62,0:06:01.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We're done here. Load up! Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.28,0:06:04.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And as for you,\Nold man, grow up!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.43,0:06:07.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This "City of Gold"\Nis just a fairytale!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.89,0:06:10.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That liar, Noland,\Ndreamt it all up!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.30,0:06:12.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you want to be\Na pirate in this new era,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you've got to wise up.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.27,0:06:16.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your dreams will\Nnever come true! Ever!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.10,0:06:23.94,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold\Ndoes exist! Hehe!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.49,0:06:27.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.29,0:06:30.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My house is pretty small!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.79,0:06:33.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya know something, junior?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.30,0:06:47.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A worthless little punk like you\Nwho is too afraid to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.43,0:06:53.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in dreams doesn't have the\Nright to call himself a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:55.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.60,0:07:05.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's like trying\Nto find a needle in a haystack.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.64,0:07:06.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We didn't even see one.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.85,0:07:08.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, we did, but we\Ncould never get close enough
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.73,0:07:12.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to grab it thanks\Nto all those stupid bugs.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.23,0:07:14.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All we did was run.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.35,0:07:16.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So seven people\Ncouldn't catch one bird?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.97,0:07:17.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's pathetic!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.84,0:07:19.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon would you\Nget it together, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.72,0:07:21.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.14,0:07:23.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've been doing this for hours!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.07,0:07:25.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can run anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Duuuuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.71,0:07:32.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Du du du du du! Duu duu!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.81,0:07:35.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He just said, "You\Nmorons think you can catch us?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.48,0:07:37.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah! Good one!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.06,0:07:38.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Morons? What nerve!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.52,0:07:39.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, birdbrain,\NI'll give you a "good one,"
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.03,0:07:42.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,right between your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:45.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Duu! Duu!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.98,0:07:50.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can grab it if I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:53.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Duuuuu!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.50,0:07:57.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pops!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.20,0:08:00.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We caught one of those birds!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.37,0:08:01.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pops! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.90,0:08:03.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Masira!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.57,0:08:05.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shojo!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.86,0:08:06.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.65,0:08:07.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.61,0:08:10.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got a better question.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.62,0:08:11.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.03,0:08:14.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, gimme a hand!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.35,0:08:15.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aahh! The Going Merry!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.89,0:08:17.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened to her?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.44,0:08:18.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.31,0:08:19.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I find out,\Nthey're gonna be sorry
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.81,0:08:22.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they ever laid a finger\Non her, the savages!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.32,0:08:23.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.57,0:08:24.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:26.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.56,0:08:27.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(567,1053)}– Don't try to move, okay?\N– I'm really sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.97,0:08:29.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(567,1053)}– Just take it easy!\N– I'm really sorry about this.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.68,0:08:32.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We did everything we could to\Nstop them, but it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.91,0:08:35.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They made us\Nlook pretty pathetic.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.44,0:08:37.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We gotta get movin' though.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.44,0:08:39.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your ship's not\Ngonna patch itself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:42.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Pops. Wait!\NTell us what happened first!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.56,0:08:44.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who did this to you?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.27,0:08:44.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.06,0:08:45.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.90,0:08:46.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.05,0:08:48.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.97,0:08:51.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you have any\Nluck finding a...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.51,0:08:53.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Duuu.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.64,0:08:56.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at that,\Nyou got yourself a South Bird.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.06,0:08:57.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.68,0:09:00.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're hard to catch.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.14,0:09:00.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:01.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.43,0:09:04.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cricket's gold! It's all gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.65,0:09:10.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That stuff?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's junk.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.23,0:09:12.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just forget it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.32,0:09:13.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.51,0:09:15.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your dream is more important.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.36,0:09:16.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to get\Nyou to the Knock...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.02,0:09:18.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forget it?\NHow can you say that?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.90,0:09:20.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think about what it\Ntook to get that gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.61,0:09:22.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ten years of diving to\Nthe bottom of the ocean!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.53,0:09:24.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Subjecting your body to all\Nthe pressures of the deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.03,0:09:27.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:31.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.61,0:09:34.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That gold, and what\Nhappens to it, is our problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:36.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.42,0:09:39.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your ship's in no shape to\Nmake it to the Knock‐Up Stream.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.42,0:09:41.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we can get all the\NSaruyama Alliance crew here,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.82,0:09:44.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they'll have it fixed\Nand reinforced by morning.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.43,0:09:48.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll still be able\Nto set sail tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.89,0:09:49.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.60,0:09:51.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything will be all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.43,0:09:54.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We will send you to the sky,\NI promise that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.26,0:09:56.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Old‐timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:09:58.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.55,0:10:07.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's Bellamy's mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:11.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You want any help?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.28,0:10:12.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this one alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.77,0:10:13.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.99,0:10:15.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.53,0:10:18.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to set\Nsail in three hours!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.77,0:10:22.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I follow the coast,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.81,0:10:25.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will that take me all the\Nway back to Mock Town?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.45,0:10:27.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, I believe it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.07,0:10:32.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you goin'?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.49,0:10:33.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:37.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly take on this\NBellamy guy all by yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.33,0:10:39.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you wanna stop him, use this.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.96,0:10:42.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kid. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.72,0:10:49.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be back by morning, guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.87,0:10:52.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, lookee there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:56.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow! Looks like the ole moon's\Nright out there under the water!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.04,0:10:58.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess my eyesight's\Nreally gettin' bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.89,0:11:00.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I better get my eyes checked
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.42,0:11:03.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or I'm gonna end up\Nfallin' off this dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:04.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahah!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.98,0:11:05.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Imagine that!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.68,0:11:07.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A pirate with bad eyesight!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.97,0:11:09.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.07,0:11:11.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think I'd rather lose one eye\Nthan have two bad ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:12.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahah.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.00,0:11:15.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Least I'd get an eyepatch!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.67,0:11:18.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A fancy one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.63,0:11:19.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.51,0:11:20.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whadda ya know!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.64,0:11:21.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A newspaper!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.48,0:11:25.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It must be the\Nreally early edition!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.65,0:11:27.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? This ain't no paper!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a stack of wanted posters!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.67,0:11:30.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.84,0:11:33.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this town comin'\Nto when low‐life scum outnumber
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.41,0:11:36.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the fine, upstanding\Ncitizens like myself?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.50,0:11:37.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.56,0:11:40.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's those spineless guys\Nfrom this afternoon!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.68,0:11:41.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.60,0:11:43.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That looney kid talkin'\Nabout the island
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.48,0:11:45.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the sky was a riot!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.62,0:11:46.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was he worth?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.61,0:11:49.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Thirty million? Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.67,0:11:53.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess my eyesight really\Nis gettin' pretty bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.88,0:11:57.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So one, ten, one hundred,\None thousand,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.97,0:12:02.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ten thousand,\None hundred thousand?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.18,0:12:06.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna need\Nsome reading glasses!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.52,0:12:08.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.94,0:12:11.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O‐One million.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.98,0:12:17.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One hundred million?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.32,0:12:22.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Three hours, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.20,0:12:26.49,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all you've got!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.53,0:12:28.50,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,If you take any longer...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.79,0:12:34.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,...we're going to lose\Nour chance to go to sky island,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.33,0:12:37.05,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,and it's going to\Nbe all your fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.09,0:12:38.18,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,He's in bad shape!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.18,0:12:40.35,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's been diving\Ndangerously like this for years,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.39,0:12:41.60,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,coming up too quick,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.77,0:12:44.98,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,and not giving the gas bubbles\Nenough time to fully dissipate!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.65,0:12:49.36,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,All I'm doing is\Nfollowing what I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.47,0:12:50.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to be my destiny.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.85,0:12:53.81,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a battle\Nbetween me and Noland.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.10,0:12:58.90,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:02.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We did what we could to stop\Nthem but it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:07.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.65,0:13:12.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those apes really cracked me up!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.40,0:13:15.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was hilarious when they\Nwere all bloody and had tears
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.32,0:13:17.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and snot runnin'\Nall down their faces,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:20.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and started cryin', "Old‐timer!"
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.66,0:13:23.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If he really meant so much,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.78,0:13:26.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they should have done a\Nbetter job of protecting him!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.33,0:13:27.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.04,0:13:28.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those guys were so lame!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.87,0:13:31.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what did you expect?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.29,0:13:32.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The same thing would\Nhave happened
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.21,0:13:34.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to anyone else\Nas stupid as them!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.51,0:13:37.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Taking on a big‐time pirate\Nworth 55 million Berries
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.26,0:13:38.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,like Bellamy?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.43,0:13:39.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's just insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.83,0:13:43.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:45.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This better be good.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.82,0:13:48.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.74,0:13:49.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ones that were\Nhere this afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:51.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.62,0:13:52.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.80,0:13:54.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What on Earth are\Nyou still doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.80,0:13:59.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You... You've gotta get outta here this instant!\NI'm serious! You're in terrible danger!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.97,0:14:02.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tch! What are\Nyou talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.81,0:14:05.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How am I in danger?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.53,0:14:33.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those two together\Nare worth a 160 million!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.28,0:14:35.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Their bounties are higher\Nthan yours, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.21,0:14:35.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Know what that means?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.91,0:14:37.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're dead meat!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.62,0:14:39.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And so are we!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.77,0:14:40.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were laughing at them!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.02,0:14:42.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think we messed\Nwith the wrong people!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.81,0:14:43.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll kill us!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.02,0:14:45.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya think they\Nremember what we look like?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.44,0:14:46.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We should get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.86,0:14:48.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.36,0:14:51.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of anyone
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.32,0:14:54.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,having a bounty\Nworth 100 million before.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.37,0:15:02.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.08,0:15:04.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All it takes to scare\Nyou big, tough guys
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.67,0:15:06.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are some little scraps of paper?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.92,0:15:09.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What, do you all have\Nempty sockets for eyes?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.26,0:15:12.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You saw their\Nscrawny, little leader!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.48,0:15:14.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Made it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.05,0:15:16.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is nothing but a sham!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.31,0:15:18.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll explain\Nit to you morons!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.24,0:15:20.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See, there are pirates\Nlike these losers who fake
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:24.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,their own wanted posters just\Nto make a name for themselves!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.23,0:15:27.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The fakers win fights\Nwithout throwing a single punch!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.25,0:15:30.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Their enemies take one look at\Nthe bogus bounties, turn tail,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.33,0:15:33.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and run just like\Nyou sorry excuses for pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:34.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are doing right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.95,0:15:36.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You saw them! They're weak!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.35,0:15:37.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They didn't even fight back!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.64,0:15:39.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But now you're all scared.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.73,0:15:41.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.27,0:15:42.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.23,0:15:44.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, they almost pulled\None over on us, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.94,0:15:45.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.02,0:15:48.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Besides, someone with a\Nbounty of 100 million would
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.19,0:15:50.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,have had to have pulled off\Nsome pretty big capers.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.45,0:15:52.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He looked pretty young,\Nif you ask me.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.27,0:15:53.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if that kid's so wanted,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:56.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,how come we've never seen his\Npicture in the papers before?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.32,0:15:57.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.49,0:16:00.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of any kid\Nin a straw hat, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:01.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got to admit!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.24,0:16:04.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was pretty scared\Nthere for a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:12.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:13.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.83,0:16:29.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. Excuse me, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:39.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:45.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, speak of the devil.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.93,0:16:48.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were just talking about you.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.10,0:16:51.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You got something\Nyou wanna say to me, kid?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.27,0:16:52.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.23,0:16:55.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Give back Pops' gold!\NEvery bit of it! Right now!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=29}===============================DIALOGUE============================
